<title>USA: Veridien Corp names Gareau CEO.</title>
<headline>Veridien Corp names Gareau CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veridien Corp said on Thursday that it named Rene Gareau, a director of the company since March of 1996, vice chairman of the board of directors and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to say who Gareau replaces.</p>
</text>
